{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/58b923086cbc32dc6c28fc3e73e9d8a4.poster.avif?t=1770269100\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/58b923086cbc32dc6c28fc3e73e9d8a4.webm?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/58b923086cbc32dc6c28fc3e73e9d8a4.mp4?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MEATSHOT, you are the legendary Headless Horseman reborn, a fearsome beast with a flaming pumpkin head, unleashed into a brutal digital world. Armed with high-powered weapons and inhuman abilities, you are an unstoppable force, carving through enemies with speed and fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/c44b66b852be79181ddecba52f853d1b.poster.avif?t=1770269100\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/c44b66b852be79181ddecba52f853d1b.webm?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/c44b66b852be79181ddecba52f853d1b.mp4?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off insane slow-mo flips and dives straight out of an action movie, shooting bullets mid-air. Leap from rooftops to crush enemies beneath your feet and skate on their dead bodies. MEATSHOT is pure action, where every battle is a high-octane dance of bullets, speed, and precision, where you control the flow of time and devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/39b46405a3cc4db7a6aab2043c4a1cac.poster.avif?t=1770269100\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/39b46405a3cc4db7a6aab2043c4a1cac.webm?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/39b46405a3cc4db7a6aab2043c4a1cac.mp4?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2537650?t=1770269100","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770269100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/dba6cc5b7d7cb97928f223e3ecfe98d1d5c67959/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770269100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/dba6cc5b7d7cb97928f223e3ecfe98d1d5c67959/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770269100","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The player engages in battles and kills enemies using various weapons, featuring blood and graphic combat."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/f284efb76e48595fee200569c94630fa.avif?t=1770269100\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/58b923086cbc32dc6c28fc3e73e9d8a4.poster.avif?t=1770269100\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/58b923086cbc32dc6c28fc3e73e9d8a4.webm?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/58b923086cbc32dc6c28fc3e73e9d8a4.mp4?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MEATSHOT, you are the legendary Headless Horseman reborn, a fearsome beast with a flaming pumpkin head, unleashed into a brutal digital world. Armed with high-powered weapons and inhuman abilities, you are an unstoppable force, carving through enemies with speed and fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/c44b66b852be79181ddecba52f853d1b.poster.avif?t=1770269100\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/c44b66b852be79181ddecba52f853d1b.webm?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537650/extras/c44b66b852be79181ddecba52f853d1b.mp4?t=1770269100\" type=\"video/m